<title>USA: Krantor settles with Procter &amp; Gamble.</title>
<headline>Krantor settles with Procter &amp; Gamble.</headline>
<dateline>DEER PARK, N.Y. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krantor Corp said Thursday it has negotiated a settlement to its lawsuit against Procter &amp; Gamble Corp.</p>
<p>The company said it has reestablished a distribution agreement with Procter &amp; Gamble.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not available to provide further details.</p>
<p>The company said Procter &amp; Gamble in 1995 accounted for 25 percent of Krantor's business, amounting to $12 million in annual sales.</p>
<p>Krantor, a food brokerage, said it expects that its association with Procter &amp; Gamble will again reach that level.</p>
</text>
